"Open source con licenza MIT. Contiene [LAME](https://lame.sourceforge.io) (LGPL) e [libwebp](https://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libwebp) (BSD)." = "Open source sous licence MIT. Contient [LAME](https://lame.sourceforge.io) (LGPL) et [libwebp](https://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libwebp) (BSD).";
